上游 2.4.1 在 Linux 上默认开启 Direct I/O(zfs_dio_enabled=1),
飞牛 zfs.ko 里这个参数在 .bss(初值 0), 和 FreeBSD 一样默认关,
O_DIRECT 请求都走 ARC。模块参数里这是唯一的默认值改动。
man/man4/zfs.4 同步。

来源: 飞牛私有改动。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 man/man4/zfs.4         | 3 ++-
 module/zfs/zfs_vnops.c | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/man/man4/zfs.4 b/man/man4/zfs.4
index a2faec4..591e817 100644
--- a/man/man4/zfs.4
+++ b/man/man4/zfs.4
@@ -299,8 +299,9 @@ Default dnode block size as a power of 2.
 .It Sy zfs_default_ibs Ns = Ns Sy 17 Po 128 KiB Pc Pq int
 Default dnode indirect block size as a power of 2.
 .
-.It Sy zfs_dio_enabled Ns = Ns Sy 1 Ns | Ns 0 Pq int
+.It Sy zfs_dio_enabled Ns = Ns Sy 0 Ns | Ns 1 Pq int
 Enable Direct I/O.
+Disabled by default on fnOS.
 If this setting is 0, then all I/O requests will be directed through the ARC
 acting as though the dataset property
 .Sy direct
diff --git a/module/zfs/zfs_vnops.c b/module/zfs/zfs_vnops.c
index 7bb9ba5..ff12693 100644
--- a/module/zfs/zfs_vnops.c
+++ b/module/zfs/zfs_vnops.c
@@ -89,7 +89,7 @@ int zfs_bclone_wait_dirty = 1;
 #ifdef __FreeBSD__
 static int zfs_dio_enabled = 0;
 #else
-static int zfs_dio_enabled = 1;
+static int zfs_dio_enabled = 0;	/* fnOS: Linux default off too */
 #endif
 
